e a live alert before humans take over. The presenter triggers a Grafana al=
ert that a sound deployment is broken due to database connectivity issues, =
and HOMS joins a dedicated Slack channel to investigate by running kubectl =
commands in the Kubernetes cluster. The incident status changes from triage=
 to major, and the automated root cause analysis reports a crash loop tied =
to a misconfigured environment variable with the wrong database name. A sho=
rtened Slack update then summarizes the incident as ready for human review =
with the identified cause.">

